`ξ ↦ m(ξ_ℓ)` on `ℝ^3`, has temperate growth. -/
theorem hasTemperateGrowth_coord {m : ℝ → ℝ} (hc : HasCompactSupport m) (hd : ContDiff ℝ ((⊤ : ℕ∞) : WithTop ℕ∞) m)
